      "section": "论起变法",
      "text": "渊海子平卷一",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c022:p0001",
      "sha256": "a5b823f6ea5176cb26de398b4c34c75d5a8a162220ac6a0c9e33ec836fae8376"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起变法",
      "text": "论起变法",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c022:p0002",
      "sha256": "e0e411effc42be354f85ea3914a70c6015600c8480c23ac9205774c2e488d2c7"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起变法",
      "text": "取时上天干合处，时下地支合处。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c022:p0003",
      "sha256": "1d7dccb6dc6c960bd28337ea739304f6e96a6aa99d4ec02263535b96c8a6d34b"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起变法",
      "text": "假如丙寅时，取天干丙与辛合，地支寅与亥合，即辛亥是也。如柱中天干无辛字，地支无亥字，乃只虚邀为是，不必拘泥。",
      "layer": "historical_work_transcription",
      "passage_id": "yuanhai:c022:p0004",
      "sha256": "e954a86785f664ade2f628b49f486e5a71ce4c885c737b0e7f915ee16f282755"
    },
    {
      "section": "论起变法",
      "text": "眉批：此等法例，时师罕见，不知此义，安能与士大夫谈命哉。",
      "layer": "historical_commentary",
      "commentary_spans": [
